WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.471
Controlled synthetic Community preview. An administrator has enabled posting.

2
00:00:02.471 --> 00:00:04.085
The group header and persistent composer stay visible while the conversation scrolls.

3
00:00:04.085 --> 00:00:05.718
Reply directly to a message. The quotation stays with your reply.

4
00:00:05.718 --> 00:00:07.338
Reactions are persisted and remain part of the conversation.

5
00:00:07.338 --> 00:00:08.909
When administrators restrict posting, history stays visible and the composer is disabled.

6
00:00:08.909 --> 00:00:10.508
Posting can be enabled again without redeployment. Production still defaults closed.
